te  rabbits deer rhinos and hippos all fall  in the prey category because they're all  herbivores but the film shows the Rhinos  and hippos as tough cops while depicting  Judy as a timid rabbit in the wild they  would all be considered prey of course a  vegetarian Rhino could still take out a  predator in a stampede while a bunny  can't do much but run and hide  still it's an interesting point of view  did we miss any big mistakes in Disney's  Zootopia  if so tell us in the comments and that's  a wrap  give this video a big thumbs up if you  love Zootopia be sure to subscribe to  our channel to be the first to catch our  latest videos thanks for watching the  things well see you soon  [Music]
 

